{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 586,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9881fb75ad7bec3417f0e14e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成果当然是100分。\\n会让大家看到无可挑剔的竞赛表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a08067cdaa1b087548a6c90dc0fcd651637664548005a1904a352c63b442d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b22f6d7f6f2eec38fa79e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为朝第1迈进的我非常有自我风格，\\n我也最喜欢这样的自己♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "906cf1281c65f3ba4cd19276ae903779642d9b21a9af3306d0d91433aa54e117",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b783f3247eb35d26a4143ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当我用自己设计的非还原型水泥替自己翻模，\\n脖子以下都被固定时，真的以为自己会死。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cee103fef1b142d4c0f04abe9e099308810fefa8bc0cb986f61f82867068e9a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e508fb9df7f93602a39e5824",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不，没有特别锁定谁喔？就算有人耍帅\\n或是大声喊叫，我也不会在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7e9ea2c09f36100357f28863f7eea7f80e65100375fdf918739c08fff485c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3fe9423866e3901741d9ed8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是不要忘记吃早餐！\\n我今天早上也吃了1磅的牛排！",
      "source_fingerprint": "506e2a664f65dbac26a0e0c2f27651729e438c45e6d21b97e51ebce827d978da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f2fb7226641a37323dd5c0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会静坐让mind平静！\\nBeauty中不足的是会想睡觉呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0c525859eae9db6cf39a369e2f9cfd2de68ec82c4bdcf0a7284dcd364b0ca4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c11b71cb610afde855e0e60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与并跑练习的伙伴一起开派对后，\\n隔天想早起会very hard！",
      "source_fingerprint": "717640bb6454cf09cc151902ef8a66175e7cc6dc88205067a1c65e7f12fe0fda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad226358b350063b4125fdf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过于紧绷反而容易受伤。\\n顺应情势，等待时机吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e495304fd6393372246bc743555f6fc14d9f30b7e059cf66e303de25a1f51ca9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9faafde9f004403165ff9cc2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "越是了解日本文化，就越能体会其\\n深奥之处，所以实在不敢自称精通……",
      "source_fingerprint": "579f47a9911c735e57f9b4d3828c7ce359c3d082119e765fde87b70a5de99662",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c093572848f4f7b608e1c54f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这我也不太清楚呢。看法应该是因人而异的。\\n要亲自确认看看吗～？呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d27c09417524591dae18e15769f395f2a8b606e94e1d73df32850264de49583",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bcd5b7ca0a1da88626c61da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是昨天发生的事，共享的西红柿酱\\n被换成了神鹰的超辣酱料……",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a70b18cbeefb7b24d51a33ef7346f7f7acb297e6200a8a55c8d8cf6516f5d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca1c8b217ea12085cc7ab6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把晚餐的胡萝卜切成星形吧。\\n一时兴起这样做后，意外地很受好评！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7631d9b7f8fe1d389743a55e14db4ab17af28beb61a64fb5767a801dceea5c4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ca4d15a1e84938bf205713",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是拥有认真迎战的意志力\\n和不轻言放弃的毅力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf19920fed3780332ccc32f79fe6e5f6fd92a29cc3926cb741829c3d22924aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9538b8721d38313cbfb9855a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵，就好好期待吧……\\n欸，我这样说是不是很帅气啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "832895f408ad1bfb78c26323d63123b68fb50c34651781a6e9a78d97ce25145b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:776a72bafdc30696108c3547",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不觉得家族名声很沉重。\\n因为目白家的荣誉就是我奔跑的理由！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7fb7ef2986f1c2ae3566471c80bc695fd7a71129c19a49e25c663a94c06e52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1694dc3c81b789c57fad4c1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是优雅地获胜吧。不过\\n当陷入激战时，也顾不了那些了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d7baecedf295bd20f6cd62039af8ec0bc8f94fb3d499d3ae6b110cf3b10204",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e440cf61d4cfe8504184213",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不太好……尤其是黄金船，\\n她都会故意炸甜甜圈给我看……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b860077d26aa6cf5debb25849031aeb02a29c6fc258ec56e8f63f35628380573",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2025d460cfb0f3c9b2ac100",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "秘诀？不不不～没有什么秘诀！\\n单纯因为神鹰我很强，所以强悍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6204269f7f764677d84b31ddfbf71c6d8c5becd2958a9facf0e5e3f8d6113599",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb9c0575ff7240add3ea0210",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会天崩地裂！\\n然后神鹰我会很沮丧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b305c902a4fe6256c713a3bd073247b149545b6bc03f9f440f2dd0949ed68b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3be3d41b7533153e626b39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呃！？啊──怎么会──那样呢──\\n我想那大概是乌鸦吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d70cb6efb034d1e87c1b15fadf752a2bc0b205f70542fc235500967ce3e31afd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d60628cfdd865f5c1cd0ed8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你们不用担心光芒变得黯淡，\\n因为你们获得了与霸王并肩的机会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbbc69d68048c356a258bdfda5c892396302a7eb9b4cdf227ddef322fbd9b58b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0f6f0c891fede63a3245fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无人岛生存真的好难熬。天呀！那里既没有\\n能映照我的镜子，也没人为我喝采！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6d82d010a0d81548e38d5b23251333f743dba5cd98290426ca49bdf799cd07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37b815a7f2245fa5f6267637",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随时都是100%！逐渐变强这种事，\\n不适用在我身上！哈哈哈哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c24fdc8635d868d2ed4f1fd0c6d4ab7ffc2d0e9329a4cd42e962a1085be77030",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8703f5664ba7893403c28048",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁知道？自己想想吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "657bcd566604ae808cb5fe27fab17d9a66ed96c977e3e6cfca1abf2c05f1c9c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:003bf093820ad7a1e21a9c9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这点不予回应……哇赛～～！\\n我一直很想这样讲看看耶！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bac11309b26ea7c746e77b9d0558ce62d05bcc06fae60f12941e09e0d2c1aa6e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbd18924baf217c51996778e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "少啰嗦。那是大姐硬塞给我的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "543dad95c25cec38eb319b6e41732609115b97f837ac4a74346dd7ada722662b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eef98adfc2575fdac1a5776",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈。如果有那种东西\\n就不有趣了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "243bc3502b84c1cc728fb22f2267292917aabd19f68aaa5791b9544be5e019e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe5c87d650894b65bed53e22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各位，我将在这场竞赛中获胜。\\n希望你们能亲眼见证我的丰功伟业！",
      "source_fingerprint": "484aff35ff3d5e2b1deccf083c6a5468358afde8f629cfb2baedfcb03f19754d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "232"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f20e10d9912e14ce9a83f22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「吃菜头讨彩头」，为了对这个伟大的\\n顺口溜致敬，我今天特地吃了萝卜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ff42b2c6573e81fa854badc7fb23fc280571f011e7eefa4124ea750f8cd74df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b692df35c3b9c93dc6588ae2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "皇帝的进击不会因为些许泥泞就停止。\\n我只需以我应有的姿态，朝顶点前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06592861a4637cbba29342e7408467fc9e576968763bf0e7dc536f63411517e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "234"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d0007050f20d9e340971f7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只相信自己的力量。不过当花坛里\\n冒出新芽时，应该算是好日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1941a5e4e6a11a945f40d68a3c7f417b1333b35d6ae9de893eafe6c21f6057a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "235"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac8b0b7439b7d2d69fcbf191",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说不累是骗人的，但我不觉得辛苦。\\n一切都是让自己成长的养分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b6134480cb392c5ee1e804d20c3bc4fa8c3c1c57f40ef3a9a5c8380bb54321",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "236"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a83bccb5dc5e130b5a0ac43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是累积过人的锻炼。在绝对的自信面前，\\n紧张感只不过是沧海一粟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbba76fe69f15b674faa9c9b060a9b87e51fe3b4f10331aff43ea2fc6fc49e9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "237"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afca2756b40af70e5ea07324",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家今天也会挥洒青春的汗水吧！\\n我会到最前线好好欣赏！看我的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acf729815960eab3fc640a5716b5ba8a799dae6a881b77550f91201dba9ab4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "238"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5037855629f09b03cc435f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咿呀！意思是叫我选出谁是主推吗！？\\n办、办不到！我是箱推！所有赛马娘都很尊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecac65aa20bcfdd6a3b602be43600a875a69230717507bc9b08f6bc9aaa1b236",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "239"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1fcf928e3954e4d2e6f4656",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘿，若说绝不想输的对象倒是有！\\n不过我会以大差的身距甩开对方获胜！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d501497908498cd76cc9f5eddf3213cd11eedde30dbd51be51912296e9cf027c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "24"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dffac9f26191c232dd677aa3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "顺从热情，认真地去跑。\\n如此一来我想冠军的荣耀就会在前方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe82cbc9c19ba114dcc89f63c62f5c11db4d1a2bd1bb50d6916665c485e7ccbf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "240"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0442e1f8a4620329b207793a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～该怎么说才好呢？有时有钓到，\\n有时没钓到，有时睡着了，各种状况都有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b79ba879e7f7f90a8f09590bf260baa449c02023f8b83c7c55be41fd53a77f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a53d37c56bb50a0f4ffe8e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然。我们昨天也一起睡了午觉哟～\\n真是个好天气呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "659df5a10eecd9e602a057f4835d568c90c90cd34a373063125b3f11733958c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "242"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c41081a45493ceb01cae820",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～～果然还是要放轻松不能着急，\\n然后看准时机的感觉吧？呀哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4300eaa0ea2ae6df41f67c3b620fce3198abc100220d114c4f5ccc7287485b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "243"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d9bc209bb65651a32f6d35",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想着那种奇怪的事会没办法跑啦。\\n爽快地拿下第一名，就只要那样就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db1f8956448b0b3169983d1f5bfc543f7e10f2155e70f1292397621d2c5551e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "244"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25c46479fb6909ca06ad8451",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟某个赛马娘并跑练习时被她说了\\n「输了就把你当小宝宝」……真是场激战啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d050309b54f0eabf47200d063754e617e057a5898d7ce2510cf7715e2399759",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "245"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da7da029c5299596e01659ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喔喔！\\n就让你们看看我帅气的地方吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f911f637bff88dacc2edc438cbfe57aa7845c6b1876a23068d600b4bf55414ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "246"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2613cbbf3fe4a59c2bd50c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想放下自己的身份或称号，\\n以一名赛马娘的身份全力以赴，享受竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "552321104744c7acf4577fd2fee661b6e48ac1396915f4baf9a301b1b6e9f566",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "247"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aca5fc1ebd16c35d4cf3b9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "观战的时候没有服装规定，\\n自由自在地真的很棒呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c463ebd468c4bd1103b6f415422071eccbeb22876d13725fd31fd7e457941a05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "248"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:459500e774aa60572b78dcf7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，竞赛结束后我想吃面上铺满蔬菜\\n然后面的硬度偏硬的拉面当作奖励♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ba8a71638dcdbca2267e770ce262c45e88e01eaeaf6b15e50d488a8c5b362f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "249"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a2e6d850412e4b9abab8893",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成果当然是100分。\\n会让大家看到无可挑剔的竞赛表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a08067cdaa1b087548a6c90dc0fcd651637664548005a1904a352c63b442d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "25"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c73175884a2c61c4210d8f80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不光是眼镜，我身上的所有东西都属于\\n胜利方程式的一环。颜色……则是个人喜好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef08f3973af432628a3041489afd3e7c807f25c94152a388cc360fbaca578532",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "250"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcd8a95a880a277c944016f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既是挚友也是劲敌……光这样形容还不够。\\n是难以解释的，超越「理论」的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b379d800af018c0ab78b0b73d444aafb26d1af8c5ccf6bb4e43a5d97bcbc746a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb99729167ec0740921dfa17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有在研究如何减少空气阻力……\\n你在看哪里？跟我的头无关喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a87a58300b09339e09d419d2f157a82eee0c71def6bea5b7abd1b03501c2d42c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "252"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6712d222922d70d47dbd1ba3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "人家会赢喔！然后呢～～会把你的视线\\n给抢过来♪做好觉悟吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2400b01f62d541e960ad116b9ab24c052995c3e5fd0fefa9aa1dc52f65852e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "253"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c0a093417b0d38ed147c76d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "非常棒喔！我会咻咻咻咻地\\n把乌云和对手都吹飞☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac76554295f0069493be2dc5e1f54eda9dbeda36e99a804606e0d465551c242e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "254"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdabeaca761055e2568a878",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～人家才该被特别留意吧♪\\n如何……？刚才那样回答很成熟吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e9c0963fc31fafdf09fdbee0f23434c58e4bc3c8a97e232a68dfa12f0818aca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "255"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0ac1bb108bc327736596cf5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………\\n我想追上……她的背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "100baae54f3cc0e7a588db85a87c6a366ee7bbc3bb5a2dc27cc3d5a222e44e02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "256"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dbb7dfb3a2851d6bee40cde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……深焙的危地马拉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae97678893c38fa61993bd959e4b5b39a42f568be2c016e50b0f5ec7eaa58866",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "257"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e489e43599822721e0edeac3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……在黑暗的房间里…………一直待着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b00c181a7ffa3042d862d9289ae6b4b1966200a9909684b8d5f248012d7eac3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "258"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18ba88f686357d6c19aa69c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "电池已经充电完毕。\\n……我开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a0e9493a9a7cc3e86bc2bea9c34361289e15dbd89812ae704d0d6ac695cf45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "259"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8597c6dacc7085844bb2c7d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为朝第1迈进的我非常有自我风格，\\n我也最喜欢这样的自己♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "906cf1281c65f3ba4cd19276ae903779642d9b21a9af3306d0d91433aa54e117",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0354094ea25de908ac7f3961",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有时候会和朋友一起\\n「朝咖啡厅爆进──！」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf47530fd79c632e99e495d6f56392905a80e8f0a99fc3947607df4d86b151a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "260"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33cf7346a36329615e56732d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "内存内是这么纪录着的，\\n「每一场都是蕴含庞大热能的激战」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a6f684bb2306b3a7d57ae93e3bef49a642fccd3b2e5b26c230a160331e07e92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7863c7299edd94c4312d8298",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个问题很难回答。腰大肌、内收肌群\\n和臀部肌群都很重要喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2263b2a7dc816d3eac9aeb8daa50ee27878b1a187eb035b0358c8ccd29b5243",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "262"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2e131944b29da9f2f441d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会看漫画。虽然是在休息，\\n但会看到心跳加速、身体发热……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b592d14668f2cc2e4c4796ce6027e710c3610e12e4b857142c2e964108a21f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "263"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62459d4338136b53b94b4b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真要说的话虽然是会觉得沉重……\\n但我也只能尽自己所能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c5cc3cf7a746d4e2087acb05bd4305aaa2493b777872f05b84c6f22264860f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "264"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd78717c9a82f4e7577bc0b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是100％喔～！就跟做给\\n小光的胡萝卜超人果汁一样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "adbd7795ba05b71a6a738f7531526865cc63f5bbe98d4fb22e32e4dedfd0837e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "265"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c79a99a4031dea226649f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "相扑火锅！因为不管什么食材都适合煮，\\n然后会变得更好吃喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "04377ec8e48c569295576b5252894273204817044ed4f1a25aaf164eccc30d24",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "266"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b88d0a3d879b78363a834877",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最喜欢将对手丢出场外的招式……\\n啊，放心～我不会在竞赛中用的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ff2701e7b537b510f714c47cc84d3b06f19921729f2a9c221b6492cf5893d07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "267"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ee76ec5300c0b038147187",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我和训练员一起努力到现在！\\n会让大家看到雪国的意志力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3508c7cd88d8dac89ad8210be5e30dc740ae8c95bac7c2cf0f1a5d10b6d4fe9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "268"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4385d0789e7b2bbd0854486a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，是故乡的记者吶！我很好喔！\\n一定要好好看看我的进步馁～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b131ba56559d3f286039e25a67f93226699f67ab7cd2a18857d56de35dd69f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "269"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b6a64e8f096996720fb56c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不，没有特别锁定谁喔？就算有人耍帅\\n或是大声喊叫，我也不会在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae7e9ea2c09f36100357f28863f7eea7f80e65100375fdf918739c08fff485c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "27"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df09d7be63cd583e581012a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家愿意来帮我加油真是太好了。\\n希望能带给大家一场满意的比赛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1daf3993a1722e67d5c0c415302477743177cc9c2d2da9a8f331236b8c2bdc0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "270"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e8d473d265504e58b9d9a0f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是、是的……那个……\\n我、我会虾油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a68e524f370f4871719f801ba726952ac230ea9e89a066174443d9a06785be2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1e8e89e0b1d3b456d736231",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为训练员非常努力协助，\\n所以……是100分！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f4c3ac327f2aea5e23c06574163701c3cd32c26e759f8070b9b883ff1d9bc43",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "272"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aebd0b02bc93ba301606472",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有！之前有跟大……跟训练员一起外出。\\n……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c181e432fe040bf8e4e70245703d8a3c3248e2358744d7759cbb0a89426bd04f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "273"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a06cb6bed4084c8d1fb3806",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈啰哈啰──！我的家人们有在看吗──？",
      "source_fingerprint": "508ef238b6fe96e7ed7062115adeaa35aaa4268ef32fa539389025308b135c3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "274"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdefb8cf6902bce8b2c53a71",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我有在打工，\\n帮很多不同的餐厅外送料理！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6ed9b5b335f06c342c98f30a7e8ce3bc4e3febb984db8156e7e7bfe63455b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "275"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a19a79bc3185bf33844c0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯──跟小朋友相处？应该吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86cb879294b0209a5e82aca6a764f239ed0d7be94dd645a4e97c56d53eb7c6f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "276"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70aeef201f85d841099d375c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "早晨会喝红茶提振精神喔。热水与砂糖的\\n比例为1:1的特调红茶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56ce64e7b9821c518a7c412d2d05cdf5a1cdbb045b093525b5246f9c8930edc1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "277"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad298feee931a9948700b648",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝对不能遗漏对跑者的观察。从动作和\\n表情能获取的信息可是很庞大的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a45db63515315a8f45c55b02058abd60ee7400641ff9b13141f0effcb73bd81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "278"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca135bb8372bf0a1b2ed7697",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是体验音速装置的运转测试吧。在拟真的\\nG力负荷面前，连我的三半规管也不行了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "767827587c89cdcb83243d9bb2d5d7c93de82ad0aafb1e9e94bc7bff9133433a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "279"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aabd3e3a0fa32b21c0a55da0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是不要忘记吃早餐！\\n我今天早上也吃了1磅的牛排！",
      "source_fingerprint": "506e2a664f65dbac26a0e0c2f27651729e438c45e6d21b97e51ebce827d978da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "28"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
